From a separate test terminal, point the base address at the defective gateway and

16
00:01:14,392 --> 00:01:20,455
choose the idempotency case. Store its artifacts in a dedicated directory. The

17
00:01:20,468 --> 00:01:25,380
expected teaching outcome is a failing regression with a nonzero exit status, because

18
00:01:25,392 --> 00:01:30,805
the correct test requires one debit and one record. Do not infer the exact failure

19
00:01:30,818 --> 00:01:35,755
details from the switch alone. Read the actual runner result and attached business

20
00:01:35,768 --> 00:01:40,618
state. They tell you which assertion failed first and what the simulator produced

21
00:01:40,630 --> 00:01:42,455
during this particular execution.

22
00:01:44,674 --> 00:01:48,899
Locate the trace belonging to the failed case and its attempt, then open it with the

23
00:01:48,911 --> 00:01:54,336
project's Playwright trace viewer. Begin at the first failing action or assertion and

24
00:01:54,349 --> 00:01:59,611
inspect the surrounding timeline. Compare the page state before and after submission

25
00:01:59,624 --> 00:02:04,649
and identify the relevant transfer requests. Do not start by scrolling through every

26
