00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:22,462
Inspect both request bodies and their idempotency headers. The body and key should be

30
00:02:22,475 --> 00:02:27,388
identical within this case. If they differ, the test may be constructing two

31
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:32,650
