00:03:54,518 --> 00:04:00,431
belongs in the test setup, locator, or application implementation. Each possibility

48
00:04:00,444 --> 00:04:05,456
needs different evidence. An explanation that merely restates the failure with more

49
00:04:05,468 --> 00:04:09,168
