52
00:04:20,969 --> 00:04:26,282
defective run. This contrast distinguishes the implementations under the exercised

53
00:04:26,294 --> 00:04:31,744
conditions. If you apply a new code correction, execute that corrected build before

54
00:04:31,756 --> 00:04:36,956
claiming it works. Keep the failing artifact as teaching evidence and the successful

55
00:04:36,969 --> 00:04:42,482
artifact as a separate result. A screenshot of edited source is not a substitute for

56
00:04:42,494 --> 00:04:44,294
